@title STORY • PRIYA: NOT YOUR CHARITY PROJECT
@bg library_night
You're Priya Patel. Pre-med. Two labs. One stats class you're tutoring for. Three practices a day if you count the one in your head.
Your phone: Mom. "Beta did you eat. Also your cousin Anjali got into Johns Hopkins early!!"
> [Bitchy] "great. love that for her." -> a1
> [Sweet] "tell her congrats!! also yes i ate" -> a2
> [Good] Put your phone in your bag. Study. -> a3
*a1
@add Pressure 2
Mom: "Beta that tone."
Priya: "it was text. there is no tone."
Mom: "I can HEAR the tone."
@jump a_done
*a2
@add Family 2
Mom: "You are my favorite daughter."
Priya: "i'm your only daughter"
Mom: "Still counts."
@jump a_done
*a3
@add Pressure 1
You read the same paragraph about the Krebs cycle six times. Anjali. Johns Hopkins. Early.
*a_done
@bg track_stadium_morning
@show holloway
Holloway: Patel. Sterling's going to help with your pacing this week.
Priya: With respect, Coach, I don't need help. Especially not from someone with a forty-eight in stats.
@show london
London: Fifty-one. Diggy tutored me.
Priya: (to Holloway) See? She's a project. Now I'm her project? This is a group project. I hate group projects.
> [Bitchy] "Fine. But I'm not slowing down for her." -> b1
> [Good] "Okay. One week. If it doesn't work, I'm out." -> b2
> [Bold] "Race me, Sterling. Winner coaches the loser." -> b3
*b1
@add Rivalry 2
London: Good. I wasn't planning to slow down for you either.
You end up running the fastest workout of your life, mostly out of spite. Holloway writes something down and smiles.
@jump b_done
*b2
@add London_Bond 2
London: (surprisingly) That's fair. Honestly, I'd say the same thing.
@jump b_done
*b3
@add Rivalry 2
@add London_Bond 1
She wins by a second. You're furious. She coaches you anyway. She's... actually good at it. You hate that most of all.
*b_done
@bg dorm_room_night
At midnight you get a text. London: "your last lap today was 4 sec faster than the rest. you hold back on purpose. why"
Nobody's ever noticed that.
> [Sweet] "because if i go all out and still lose, then i'm just not good enough." -> c1
> [Bitchy] "mind your business sterling" -> c2
> [Bold] "because i'm scared." -> c3
*c1
@add London_Bond 3
London: "you're good enough. go all out saturday. i'll be screaming at you the whole time"
Priya: "is that supposed to be comforting"
London: "yes"
@jump end
*c2
London: "ok. but you know i'm right"
She is right. You stare at the ceiling until 2 a.m.
@jump end
*c3
@add London_Bond 3
London: "me too. every race. go anyway"
You screenshot it. You'll never admit that you did.
*end
Priya Patel has a plan for everything except what happens if she stops holding back. This year, she finds out.
